  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A brow tool with a retractable pencil and detachable spoolie that defines, fills, and grooms. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This brow tool gives your brows natural-looking definition and feathery fullness for the ultimate Bonne Brow. It is made with 100 percent naturally derived pigments so the gentle-yet-firm texture glides on effortlessly. The angled tip mimics hair-like strokes for just-right, soft-to-bold brows while the dry, precision spoolie provides superior control.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Gucci Westman's Tip: Your dry spoolie is your &quot;fixer.&quot; Use it as a grooming tool and an eraser to blend or soften.<br>-Start by brushing brows upward with dry spoolie, following natural hair direction.<br>-Use your pencil as a guide for where brows should begin and end.<br>-Hold pencil vertically from the lower corner of the nose and follow the lineup&mdash;this is where brows should begin.<br>-Tilt pencil diagonally from the same starting point to the outer corner of your eye and follow the line to your temple&mdash;this is where brows should end. <br>-Apply gentle, baby strokes to fill where needed&mdash;the lighter the touch the better.<br>-Repeat until just right.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Stearic Acid, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Triethylhexanoin, Neopentyl Glycol Dicaprate, Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Dipentaerythrityl Pentaisostearate, Polyglyceryl-2, Triisostearate, Tocopherol, Aluminum Hydroxide.<br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A brow tool with a retractable pencil and detachable spoolie that defines, fills, and grooms. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This brow tool gives your brows natural-looking definition and feathery fullness for the ultimate Bonne Brow. It is made with 100 percent naturally derived pigments so the gentle-yet-firm texture glides on effortlessly. The angled tip mimics hair-like strokes for just-right, soft-to-bold brows while the dry, precision spoolie provides superior control.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Gucci Westman's Tip: Your dry spoolie is your &quot;fixer.&quot; Use it as a grooming tool and an eraser to blend or soften.<br>-Start by brushing brows upward with dry spoolie, following natural hair direction.<br>-Use your pencil as a guide for where brows should begin and end.<br>-Hold pencil vertically from the lower corner of the nose and follow the lineup&mdash;this is where brows should begin.<br>-Tilt pencil diagonally from the same starting point to the outer corner of your eye and follow the line to your temple&mdash;this is where brows should end. <br>-Apply gentle, baby strokes to fill where needed&mdash;the lighter the touch the better.<br>-Repeat until just right.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Stearic Acid, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Triethylhexanoin, Neopentyl Glycol Dicaprate, Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Dipentaerythrityl Pentaisostearate, Polyglyceryl-2, Triisostearate, Tocopherol, Aluminum Hydroxide.<br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
